{
  "title": "oRings",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Idea",
      "lines": [
        "A resonator played",
        "from MIDI: each note",
        "strikes a modal body",
        "or a string, which",
        "rings and decays on",
        "its own. The DSP is",
        "the original open-",
        "source Rings code,",
        "run at 48 kHz."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Playing",
      "lines": [
        "Press Play on Move:",
        "a strike on every",
        "1/16 whose step pad",
        "is on, at PITCH.",
        "Stopped = silent.",
        "MIDI notes strike",
        "too, at their own",
        "pitch. Note-off does",
        "nothing: DAMP sets",
        "the decay.",
        "Velocity = how hard",
        "(see VELO)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Main page",
      "lines": [
        "1 VOLUME",
        "2 STRUCT harmonic",
        "        structure",
        "3 BRIGHT tone",
        "4 DAMP  decay time",
        "5 POS   where it is",
        "        struck",
        "6 POLY  1-4 voices",
        "7 MODEL 12 modes",
        "8 PITCH note of the",
        "        scale",
        "Knobs 2-5 change",
        "name with MODEL."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Models",
      "lines": [
        "MODAL  modal body",
        "SYMPA  sympathetic",
        "       strings",
        "STRNG  inharmonic",
        "       string",
        "KVERB  Karplusverb",
        "FM     2-op FM",
        "CHORD  Western",
        "       Chords",
        "DP-..  Disastrous",
        "       Peace: string",
        "       machine with",
        "       FM=formant,",
        "       CH=chorus,",
        "       RV=reverb,",
        "       F2, EN=ensem-",
        "       ble, R2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Mode knobs",
      "lines": [
        "FM: RATIO, INDEX,",
        "  DECAY, FDBK",
        "KVERB: DCY+RV =",
        "  decay + reverb",
        "Chord models: the",
        "  chord is on the",
        "  Scale page",
        "DP: CUTOFF, REGIST",
        "  (organ stops),",
        "  ENV (attack/",
        "  decay), then the",
        "  effect amount"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Rings page",
      "lines": [
        "1 FREQ  transpose",
        "        -24..+24 st",
        "2 FINE  cents",
        "3 EXCITE strike",
        "        strength %",
        "4 SPREAD ms between",
        "        MIDI chords",
        "5 VELO  velocity",
        "        response %",
        "6 BEND  bend range",
        "7 OUTPUT STEREO =",
        "  ODD L / EVEN R,",
        "  SUM, ODD, EVEN",
        "8 GAIN  dB"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Scale page",
      "lines": [
        "1 ROOT  of PITCH",
        "2 SCALE of PITCH",
        "3 STEPS loop 8/16",
        "4 RESET click to",
        "  silence all",
        "5 CHORD chord",
        "  models only"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pads",
      "lines": [
        "While this screen is",
        "up the pads are",
        "oRings':",
        "Top right: REC,",
        "  RANDOM, MODELS.",
        "Row 2: presets 1-8.",
        "Bottom 2 rows: the",
        "  16 steps on/off.",
        "  White = playing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "REC motion",
      "lines": [
        "REC on + Move",
        "playing: touch a",
        "knob and turn it to",
        "record its move.",
        "Shift+touch: clear",
        "that knob.",
        "Shift+touch VOLUME:",
        "clear all.",
        "Recorded: knobs 2-5,",
        "PITCH, EXCITE."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "RANDOM",
      "lines": [
        "Writes a new melody",
        "into PITCH, one note",
        "per step, all in",
        "ROOT + SCALE, around",
        "the PITCH knob's",
        "note. Press again",
        "for another.",
        "Shift+touch PITCH",
        "clears it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Presets",
      "lines": [
        "Row 2 pads:",
        "tap = recall,",
        "Shift+tap = save.",
        "Saves knobs, motion,",
        "steps and scale.",
        "Dark = empty,",
        "dim = saved,",
        "white = current."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "MODELS list",
      "lines": [
        "Pad MODELS opens it.",
        "Jog: move, click:",
        "on/off. The MODEL",
        "knob offers only the",
        "models that are on.",
        "Back closes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Odd / Even",
      "lines": [
        "1 voice: the two",
        "pickups of one body.",
        "2-4 voices: voices",
        "alternate between",
        "ODD (left) and",
        "EVEN (right)."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
